    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n73857" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ὁμό-τεχνος</span></b> , <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ον</span>,
			<div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>practising the same art,</i>
			<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τινι</span> with one, <i><span class="en">
				Pl.
				<u>La.</u>
				187a
			</span></i>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>II.</b> as
				Subst., <i>fellow-workman,</i>
			<i><span class="en">
				Hdt.
				2.89
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
